a Harvard law professor suggested that Trump's&nbsp;
legal team should get him to plead insanity if he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:31.020
does go on trial. In a tweet Sunday, the professor&nbsp;
Laurence Tribe, an expert on constitutional law,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:36.720
commented on Trump's video message to the House&nbsp;
Select Committee on January six, 2021. If this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:42.000
is the defense at Trump's forthcoming trial, I&nbsp;
don't envy the lawyers who agree to represent him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:49.500
Tribe tweeted. They'd better be psychiatrists,&nbsp;
expert at reflexive projection and capable of&nbsp;&nbsp;

